# Test requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension
# The session cookie from register/login is reused automatically by REST Client

@api = http://localhost:4000/api

### Health check
GET {{api}}/health

### Unknown route, expects 404
GET {{api}}/does-not-exist

### Register
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Léa", "email": "lea@exemple.fr", "password": "Correct-Horse-9!", "language": "fr" }

### Login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lea@exemple.fr", "password": "Correct-Horse-9!" }

### Current user (needs the session cookie)
GET {{api}}/auth/me

### Logout
POST {{api}}/auth/logout

### Forgotten password (paste the recovery code shown at signup)
POST {{api}}/auth/recover
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lea@exemple.fr", "recoveryCode": "XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX", "password": "New-Password-42!" }

### New recovery code (needs the session cookie and the current password)
POST {{api}}/auth/recovery-code
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "New-Password-42!" }

### Categories (needs the session cookie)
GET {{api}}/categories

### Transactions of a month, with optional filters: category, type, q
GET {{api}}/transactions?month=2026-10

### Add an expense (amount in cents: 2380 = 23,80 €)
POST {{api}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXPENSE", "amountCents": 2380, "date": "2026-10-16", "categoryId": "groceries", "note": "Supermarché" }

### "Other" needs a note
POST {{api}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "EXPENSE", "amountCents": 1500, "date": "2026-10-16", "categoryId": "other", "note": "Coiffeur" }

### Budget of a month (falls back to the latest earlier budget)
GET {{api}}/budgets?month=2026-10

### Set the budget of a month (80000 = 800 €)
PUT {{api}}/budgets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "month": "2026-10", "amountCents": 80000 }

### Dashboard of a month
GET {{api}}/dashboard?month=2026-10
